        "original_id": "0d148e96-3e10-5758-ad3a-cb75f1f0f427",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Anna Camp, Maggie Kiley, Samuel Page, Stefanie Scott, Amelia Rose Blaire\n- Films: Pitch Perfect, Pitch Perfect 2, Pitch Perfect 3, Caught\n- Organizations: The Bellas, Barden University\n- Topics: acting roles, film premises\n\nFacts:\n- In 2012, Anna Camp played Aubrey Posen in the film \"Pitch Perfect.\"\n- In 2015, Anna Camp reprised Aubrey Posen in the film \"Pitch Perfect 2.\"\n- In 2015, \"Pitch Perfect 2\" centered on the fictional Barden University and The Bellas, an all-female a cappella singing group.\n- In 2015, \"Caught\" was released as an American psychological thriller film directed by Maggie Kiley.\n- In 2015, \"Caught\" starred Anna Camp, Samuel Page, Stefanie Scott, and Amelia Rose Blaire.\n- In 2017, Anna Camp was identified as appearing as Aubrey Posen in the upcoming film \"Pitch Perfect 3.\"",
